__d(function(g,r,i,a,m,e,d){"use strict";Object.defineProperty(e,'__esModule',{value:!0}),Object.defineProperty(e,"PRIVACY",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return s}}),Object.defineProperty(e,"TERMS",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return u}});var o=r(d[0]);const t=o.SUPPORT_EMAIL||'[contact email]',n=`${o.LEGAL_NAME}, ${o.LEGAL_ADDRESS}`,s={title:'Privacy policy',updated:'19 October 2026',intro:`This policy explains what Govori collects, why, who it is shared with and the choices you have. Govori is run by ${n} ("we", "us"). We are the controller of your personal data under UK data protection law. Questions: ${t}.`,sections:[{h:'The short version',list:['You can use Govori without an account. Your progress then stays on your device.','We do not show adverts, use advertising or analytics trackers, or sell your data.','If you sign in, we keep your progress and a learner profile on our servers so you can sync devices and use friends and leagues. Only you can read your profile; other learners see at most your display name and this week\'s XP, and under 18s are never shown to other learners.','Messages you write to the AI tutor are sent to Anthropic, our AI provider, to create replies. We do not keep the conversations.','You can delete your account and its data at any time in the app.']},{h:'On your device',p:['Your progress, settings, chosen course and downloaded course material are stored on your device. Daily reminders are scheduled by your device. The home screen widget reads your streak and XP from the app on your device.']},{h:'If you create an account',list:['Account: your email address and the sign-in identifier from Apple, Google or our email code, plus your name if Apple or Google share it. We use these to create your account and keep you signed in.','Age group: before you create an account we ask whether you are under 13, 13 to 15, 16 or 17, or 18 or over. It is saved with your progress (and synced to your account once you have one) and sets safe defaults: under 13s cannot create an account, under 18s get private settings, and the swear words unit is only for 16 and over.','Progress sync: a copy of your learning progress, XP, streaks and settings, so you can learn on more than one device and keep your work if you change phone.','Learner profile: your display name, username, current course, XP, streak, the days you practised in the last 60 days, weekly XP and league. Only you can read your profile. Other learners (your league, and people who follow you by your exact username) see at most your display name, username and this week\'s XP, and only if you are 18 or over and switch on "Show my name in leagues" in Settings. Under 18s and anyone with that setting off show as "Learner" and cannot be found by username. You can change your name and username in your profile.','Friends: who you follow, high fives and nudges you send and receive, people you block and reports you make.','Push notifications: if you allow notifications, a push token so a friend\'s nudge can reach you. Nudges are delivered through Expo\'s push service.','Subscription status: whether you have Premium and when it renews or ends.','AI tutor use: how many tutor messages you sent each day, to apply fair-use limits.']},{h:'The AI tutor, "Explain", writing checks and "Read a sign"',p:['When you use the AI tutor, ask for an explanation or have your writing checked, what you write, the recent conversation, your course and your level are sent through our server to Anthropic, which generates the reply. We do not store the conversations on our servers. Anthropic processes them as our service provider under its commercial terms. Please do not share sensitive personal information with the tutor.','When you use "Read a sign", the photo you take or choose is sent through our server to Anthropic so the text in it can be read and explained. We do not store the photo. Please avoid photos that show people or personal details.']},{h:'Speaking exercises',p:["Speaking exercises use your device's own speech recognition from Apple or Google. Depending on your device and language, your voice may be processed on the device or by Apple or Google under their privacy terms. We never receive or store recordings, only the words recognised, to mark your answer on your device."]},{h:'Purchases',p:['Subscriptions are sold and billed by Apple or Google. We never see your card details. We use RevenueCat to check whether you have Premium. It receives an app user ID (your account ID if you are signed in) and the purchase records from the store.']},{h:'Reports and crash reports',list:['Reporting a mistake: the exercise, story or tutor reply, your answer, your note, your course, the app version and your device type. Linked to your account if you are signed in.','Reporting a learner: who you reported, the reason, your note and the name they used at the time.','Crash reports: if the app hits an error, we receive the error message and technical details, the screen you were on, your course, the app version and your device type and system version. Linked to your account if you are signed in. We use them only to fix bugs.']},{h:'Why we can use your data (lawful bases)',list:['To provide the service you asked for (contract): your account, sync, friends, leagues, the tutor and Premium.','Our legitimate interests: keeping the community safe (reports, blocking, name checks), fixing bugs (crash reports) and improving the course (mistake reports).','Your consent: push notifications and reminders, which you can switch off at any time.','Legal obligations: for example keeping records the law requires.']},{h:'Who we share it with',p:[`We use these service providers, who may only use your data to provide their service to us: Supabase (database, sign-in and server functions; data stored in ${o.DATA_REGION}), Anthropic (AI tutor), RevenueCat (subscriptions), Apple and Google (sign-in, payments, notifications and speech recognition) and Expo (delivering push notifications). We do not sell your data. We may disclose information if the law requires it or to protect people from harm.`,'Some providers are in the United States. Where data leaves the UK, we rely on the safeguards UK law requires, such as the UK Extension to the EU-US Data Privacy Framework or the International Data Transfer Agreement.']},{h:'How long we keep it',list:['Account, progress, profile and friends: until you delete your account. Deleting it in the app (Account > Delete account) removes them from our live database straight away; backups are overwritten within 30 days.','Mistake reports and learner reports: up to 2 years. If you delete your account, mistake reports stay but are no longer linked to you.','Crash reports: up to 12 months.','Tutor message counts: up to 12 months.']},{h:'Your rights',p:[`You can ask to see, correct, delete or get a copy of your data, and object to or restrict how we use it. Email ${t}. You can delete your account yourself in the app. If you are unhappy with how we handle your data, you can complain to the Information Commissioner's Office (ico.org.uk), but please talk to us first so we can try to put it right.`]},{h:'Children',p:['Govori is not meant for children under 13, and you must be 13 or over to create an account. For learners aged 13 to 17 we use private settings by default: names are hidden in leagues, and anyone can block or report others. The swear words unit is only for people aged 16 or over and is off unless switched on in Settings. If you think a child under 13 has given us personal data, contact us and we will delete it.']},{h:'Security',p:['Data travels encrypted. Our database only lets each person read their own private data, and other learners can only see the learner profile described above. No system is perfectly secure, so please use a strong password for your Apple, Google or email account.']},{h:'Changes',p:['If we change this policy in a way that matters, we will tell you in the app before the change takes effect.']}]},u={title:'Terms of use',updated:'19 October 2026',intro:`These terms are an agreement between you and ${n} ("we", "us") about using Govori. Please read them. They do not affect your legal rights as a consumer. Questions: ${t}.`,sections:[{h:'Who can use Govori',list:['You must be 13 or over to create an account. If you are under 18, check with a parent or guardian before buying a subscription.','The swear words unit is only for people aged 16 or over. It teaches strong language for understanding real conversations and is off until you switch it on and confirm your age.','The slang and memes unit uses informal language and humour that some people may find rude.']},{h:'Your account',p:['Keep your sign-in details safe and tell us if you think someone else has used your account. One account per person. You can delete your account at any time in the app.']},{h:'Premium subscriptions',list:['Premium is sold and billed by the Apple App Store or Google Play. The price and length are shown before you buy.','Subscriptions renew automatically unless you cancel at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Cancel in your Apple or Google account settings. Deleting the app or your Govori account does not cancel a subscription.','If a free trial is offered, it turns into a paid subscription when it ends unless you cancel before then.','Refunds are handled by Apple or Google under their policies. Your statutory rights are not affected.','Gems, streak freezes and other rewards you earn in the app have no money value and cannot be exchanged, sold or transferred.']},{h:'Community rules',p:['Other learners see your name and username in friends and leagues. You agree not to:'],list:['use a name or username that is offensive, hateful, sexual, threatening or pretends to be someone else (including Govori staff);','harass, bully, threaten or spam other learners;','cheat in leagues, for example with automated tools;','copy, scrape, resell or reverse engineer the app or its content, or try to break its security.']},{h:'How we enforce the rules',p:['You can report or block any learner from friends or leagues. We review reports within 24 hours. We may hide or change a name, remove someone from leagues, or suspend or close an account that breaks these rules, and we will tell you why unless the law or safety stops us.']},{h:'The AI tutor',p:['Replies from the AI tutor and "Explain" are written by artificial intelligence. They are usually helpful but can be wrong, so do not rely on them for anything important such as legal, medical or immigration matters. Do not share sensitive personal information with the tutor. Fair-use limits apply, and we may limit use that looks automated or abusive. You can report a reply with the flag next to it.']},{h:'Learning content',p:['We work hard to make the courses accurate, and native speakers review them. Languages vary by region, and mistakes can slip through; please report them with the flag in a lesson. Govori is a learning aid: it does not guarantee that you will pass an exam or meet a visa, citizenship or job requirement.']},{h:'Our content',p:['The courses, stories, characters, artwork, sounds and software in Govori belong to us or our licensors. We give you a personal, non-transferable licence to use the app for your own learning, not for commercial use.']},{h:'Changes and availability',p:['We keep improving Govori, so features and content may change. We will give you reasonable notice of changes that significantly affect a paid subscription. We try to keep Govori available but cannot promise it will always be uninterrupted or error-free.']},{h:'Our responsibility to you',p:['If we break these terms, we are responsible for loss or damage you suffer that is a foreseeable result of our breach or our failure to use reasonable care and skill. We are not responsible for losses that were not foreseeable, or for business losses, because Govori is for personal use.','Nothing in these terms limits our liability for death or personal injury caused by our negligence, for fraud, or for anything else the law does not allow us to limit. If digital content we supply damages your device and we did not use reasonable care and skill, we will repair the damage or pay you compensation.']},{h:'If you got Govori from the Apple App Store',list:['These terms are between you and us, not Apple. We, not Apple, are responsible for Govori and its content.','Apple has no obligation to provide maintenance or support for Govori.','If Govori fails to meet any applicable warranty, you can tell Apple and Apple will refund the purchase price (if any). Apple has no other warranty obligation for Govori.','We, not Apple, are responsible for dealing with any claims about Govori, including product liability, legal or regulatory compliance, consumer protection and intellectual property claims.','You confirm you are not in a country subject to a US Government embargo and are not on a US Government list of prohibited or restricted parties.','Apple and its subsidiaries are third-party beneficiaries of these terms and can enforce them against you.']},{h:'Ending these terms',p:['You can stop using Govori and delete your account at any time. We may suspend or close an account that seriously or repeatedly breaks these terms. If we close an account with an active subscription without good reason, we will refund the unused part where the store allows.']},{h:'Law',p:['These terms are governed by the law of England and Wales. You can bring legal proceedings in the courts of England and Wales; if you live in Scotland or Northern Ireland, you can also bring them there. If you live in the EU, you keep the protection of the mandatory consumer laws of your country.']},{h:'Changes to these terms',p:['If we change these terms in a way that matters, we will tell you in the app before the change takes effect. If you do not agree, you can stop using Govori and cancel your subscription.']}]}},1277,[879]);
